      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm drafting a policy memo for a senior partner regarding wealth redistribution strategies to maintain long-term stability in the US. Based on current economic trends and data, which approach is more likely to ensure societal stability: a Universal Basic Income (UBI) model or continuing to refine targeted welfare programs?",
