    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. So you're saying the fiscal risks are basically worth it for the social benefits. If I'm writing this for a partner who is skeptical of the \"progressive taxation\" solution, how would you frame the argument that UBI is the only viable path forward for the US, rather than just one of several options?",
